WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
<v DANA>So what happens after a needlestick like
that?

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:08.156
<v RAY>There's a report to a supervisor, and
then there's a medical evaluation, with

00:00:08.156 --> 00:00:10.480
<v RAY>testing for H-I-V and hepatitis B.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.960
<v DANA>And what happens after the testing?

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.880
<v RAY>Then comes the waiting, and the results
can take weeks.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.840
<v DANA>[softly] That's a long time to carry a
question around.

